Description: TT LCD Studio window for the Thermaltake TH240 V2 Ultra (CL-W383) LCD
 Window with dashboard, live preview, display modes (image, GIF, colour,
 clock, Aura Sync, off), device and settings pages and the idle picture,
 plus a tray icon (libayatana-appindicator3). Complete on its own: it also
 contains everything in the ttlcd package (the ttlcd command, the systemd
 user service, the udev rule and the rescue tool) and replaces it, so this
 one file installs from the Ubuntu App Center too.
